            </p>

            <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-navy-700/80 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
              <div><span class="text-slate-400">TO:</span> Designated Decision-Maker / Senior Immigration Officer</div>
